    </p>
    <p style="box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; 0px 9px 0px;">
        Your login: <t t-out="object.email" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true"></t>
        <br/>
    </p>
    <p style="box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; 0px 9px 0px;">
        To gain access to your account, you can use the following link:
    </p>
    <div style="font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center; margin-top: 16px;">
        <a style="border-style:solid;box-sizing:border-box;border-left-color:#875a7b;border-bottom-color:#875a7b;border-right-color:#875a7b;border-top-color:#875a7b;border-left-width:1px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-top-width:1px;text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:#008784;padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#875A7B; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #875A7B; border: 1px solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px" t-attf-href="/web/login?auth_login={{object.email}}">Go to My Account</a>
    </div>
    <p style="box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; 0px 9px 0px;">Best regards,</p>
</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;padding:0px;width:600px;margin:auto; margin-top: 10px; background: #fff repeat top /100%;color:#777777">
    <t t-out="user.signature" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true"></t>
    <p style="box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; 0px 9px 0px;font-size: 11px; margin-top: 10px;">
        <strong style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold;">Sent by <t t-out="user.company_id.name" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true"></t> using <a href="www.odoo.com" style="box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:#008784; color: #875A7B;">Odoo</a></strong>
    </p>
</div>
        </field>
    </record>
    
    <record id="achosa_mail_template_data_unregistered_users" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">Auth Signup: Unregistered Users</field>
        <field name="model_id" ref="achosa.model_res_users"/>
        <field name="email_from">{{object.company_id.partner_id.email_formatted}}</field>
        <field name="email_to">{{object.email_formatted}}</field>
        <field name="subject">Reminder for unregistered users</field>
        <field name="body_html" type="html">
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#F1F1F1;font-family:Verdana, Arial,sans-serif; color: #454748; width: 100%; border-collapse:separate;"><tbody><tr><td align="center">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="590" style="border-collapse:collapse;padding:16px;background-color: white; color: #454748; border-collapse:separate;">
<tbody>
    <!-- CONTENT -->
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="min-width:590px;">
            
                 <t t-set="invited_users" t-value="ctx.get('invited_users', [])" data-oe-t-inline="true"></t>
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="590" style="border-collapse:collapse;min-width:590px;background-color: white; padding: 0px 8px 0px 8px; border-collapse:separate;"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left">
                    <span style="font-size:20px;font-weight: bold;">
                        Pending Invitations
                    </span><br/><br/>
                </td>
                </tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-size:13px;">
                    <div style="font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;">
                        Dear <t t-out="object.name or ''" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable=""></t>,<br/> <br/>
                        You added the following user(s) to your database but they haven't registered yet:
                        <ul style="margin:0px 0 1rem 0;">
                            <t t-foreach="invited_users" t-as="invited_user">
                                <li><t t-out="invited_user" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable=""></t></li>
                            </t>
                        </ul>
                        Follow up with them so they can access your database and start working with you.
                        <br/><br/>
                        Have a nice day!<br/>
                        --<br/>The <t t-out="object.company_id.name" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable=""></t> Team
                    </div>
                </td></tr>
                <tr><td style="text-align:center;">
                  <hr width="100%" style="margin:1rem 0 1rem 0;border-top-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1px;border-left-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;overflow-y:visible;overflow-x:visible;height:0px;box-sizing:content-box;background-color:rgb(204,204,204);border:medium none;clear:both;display:block;font-size:0px;min-height:1px;line-height:0; margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;" contenteditable="false" oe-keep-contenteditable=""/>
                </td></tr>
            </tbody></table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
        </field>
    </record>
            
    <!-- Email template for Subscriber Anniversary -->
    <record id="subscriber_anniversary_mail" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">Homeowner Anniversary Email</field>
        <field name="model_id" ref="achosa.model_sale_subscription"/>
        <field name="email_from">{{ object.company_id.email }}</field>
        <field name="email_to">{{ object.partner_id.email }}</field>
        <field name="subject">
            One Month Until Your
             {{ object.get_anniversary_details()['anniversary_number'] }} Achosa Anniversary!
        </field>

        <field name="body_html" type="html">
            <p>Thank you for your home warranty with Achosa.</p><br/>
            <t t-set="anniversary_details" t-value='object.get_anniversary_details()'/>
            <p>We are sending you this note to let you know that <strong t-esc='anniversary_details["anniversary_date"]'> </strong>
                 will mark your <strong t-esc='anniversary_details["anniversary_number"]'> </strong> Anniversary with Achosa.
                 Since you protected your home, we have saved our customers millions
                 of dollars in home repair bills while seeing more and more customers choose Achosa.</p><br/>
            <p>As you are already on a monthly plan, you need do nothing to continue with our service.
                However, if you wish to cancel, just
                <t t-if="object.get_portal_url()">
                    <a target="_blank" class="badge badge-pill badge-info" t-attf-href="/my/subscription/cancel/{{object.id}}/{{object.access_token}}">Click Here</a>
                </t>
                to initiate your cancellation request. </p>
            <br/>
            <p>We appreciate your business!</p>
            <p>
                <t t-if="object.user_id.signature">
                    <t t-out="object.user_id.signature or ''"/>
                </t>
            </p>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="crm_prospect_email" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">Prospect Monthly Email</field>
        <field name="model_id" ref="achosa.model_crm_lead"/>
        <field name="email_from">{{object.user_id.login}}</field>
        <field name="email_to">{{ object.partner_id.email }}</field>
        <field name="subject">ACHOSA Monthly Email</field>
        <field name="body_html" type='html'>
            <h3 style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">For years real estate agents have been asking home warranty companies to be better. At Achosa Home Warranty, we've listened! We empower the homeowner to control the entire claim process by working with any service provider they choose.<br/></h3>
            <p style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">
                <br/>
            </p>
            <ul style="margin:0px 0 12px 0;box-sizing:border-box;">
                <li>Homeowner selects the licensed service provider of their choice. This leads to faster response times, improved communication, better contractors and happier home owners.<br/></li>
                <li>Achosa pays service providers their full retail rates (up to our limits) for repairs or replacements while they are in the home when the work is completed to the homeowner's satisfaction.<br/></li>
                <li>Labor and parts can be sourced hyper-locally, keeping claim dollars in the local economy and reducing homeowner wait times.<br/></li>
                <li>Based on surveys completed by homeowners after the claim, we have an industry leading NPS (Net Promoter Score) of 75.<br/></li>
            </ul>
            <p style="margin:0px 0 12px 0;box-sizing:border-box;">
                <br/>
            </p>
            <h3 style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">Is this week or next week better for you to learn more about providing this protection to your clients?</h3>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="crm_VCO_email" model="mail.template">
        <field name="name">VCO Monthly Email</field>
        <field name="model_id" ref="achosa.model_crm_lead"/>
        <field name="email_from">{{object.user_id.login}}</field>
        <field name="email_to">{{object.partner_id.email}}</field>
        <field name="subject">ACHOSA Monthly Email</field>
        <field name="body_html" type='html'>
            <h3 style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">Based on our last conversation, I know you're excited about what Achosa Home Warranty has to offer your clients. Now is the best time to be sure your clients are protected!</h3>
            <p style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">
                <br/>
            </p>
            <h3 style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">Do you have a closing coming up with a home warranty written in the contract? If so, I'm happy to get the warranty ordered for you. I just need the address, buyers name, email &amp; phone number, closing date and the amount written in for the warranty.</h3>
            <p style="caret-color:#37352f;position:relative;margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">
                <br/>
            </p>
            <h3 style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">If you have a closing without a warranty written in, I'd love to reach out to your client and share the benefits of Achosa. Just connect us by email or share their contact information with me, and I'll take it from there.</h3>
            <p style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">
                <br/>
            </p>
            <h3 style="margin:0px 0 6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16.9px;color:#091124;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;">While a home warranty might seem like a small detail before closing, you will be the hero when Achosa saves them money on costly home repairs to the systems and appliances in their home.
                <br/>
            </h3>
        </field>
    </record>

